OL,3,ATories pay artist for Burnham images
OL,4,Aafter legal threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have agreed to pay an
OL,7,Fartist who threatened to sue the party
OL,8,Fafter it used his illustration of Andy
OL,9,FBurnham to mock the prime minister.
OL,11,FStanley Chow posted on Facebook that
OL,12,Fthe party had used the picture - which
OL,13,FBurnham has used on social media -
OL,14,Fwithout permission.
OL,16,FHe had sought legal advice and
OL,17,Fthreatened to take action against the
OL,18,Fparty. It is understood the Tories
OL,19,Fagreed to pay a #1,000 fee for use of
OL,20,Fthe image - and contributed an unknown
OL,21,Fsum to Chow's legal fees.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
